569 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Modern electronics are often closed systems that depend on company\055controlled software\054 cloud services\054 and mobile networks\056 This means companies can control how people use their devices and communicate\056 GridSkip was created in the design studio as an alternative\072 a small\054 battery\055powered text communicator that works without the internet\054 cellular networks\054 or cloud services\056 It uses 433 MHz LoRa radio to send messages directly\054 allowing people to communicate independently\056\050\050I realized that open\055source hardware has little impact if people can only see it in an exhibition\056 So\054 the project moved into its second phase\072 creating a user\055friendly\054 hands\055on website and build guide that helps anyone\054 anywhere\054 source parts\054 3D print the case\054 connect the wires\054 install the software\054 and build their own mesh communicator\056\050\050)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 570 0 R
     /Pg 396 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

