571 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Rather than relying on flat photography\054 the web build guide opens with a dynamic Three\056js WebGL CAD explosion\056 Visitor  can orbit 360\260 and hover over discrete components to inspect\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 572 0 R
     /Pg 396 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
